# Simple Flashcards

Parallel module — **not** vocab `decks` / SM-2.

## Data

- `simple_decks`, `simple_cards` (front/back rich HTML via TipTap: bold/italic/lists), `simple_card_stats`, `simple_learning_sessions`
- Indexes via `create_indexes` on FastAPI startup (Render) or `python src/init_indexes.py`

## API (`/simple/...`)

- CRUD decks/cards + `GET /simple/search?q=` (title, front, back)
- Deck editor: draft locally, then `POST /simple/decks/{id}/cards/sync` `{create, update, delete_ids}` in one round-trip
- Study: start returns full shuffled `cards`; Forgot/Remembered run client-side; `POST .../complete` flushes events + stats once
- Quick 5 min: `mode=quick_5` ranks by `weakness_score = forget_count - remember_count` (only score > 0, max 12); FE `/simple/study?deck_id=&mode=quick_5`
- Do not call `services.update_user_progress`

## FE

- `/simple`, `/simple/:id` (draft + Save), `/simple/study?deck_id=`
- Nav link **Simple**; use `useApi()` + `SimpleFlashcard.vue`
- On `/simple/:id`: add/edit/delete are local until Save; search filters draft client-side
